elated NPCs: Various"]},"links":["Cabilis","Grand Master Glox","Monk","Shackle of Dust","Shackle of Clay","Shackle of Stone","Shackle of Rock","Shackle of Copper","Shackle of Bronze","Shackle of Steel","The Penance","Goblin Scout Beads","Large Scorpion Pincer","A froglok skipper","Skipping stone","Sabertooth Cub Canine","First Rite Pack","Lake of Ill Omen","Field of Bone","Skipping Stone","Swamp of No Hope","Full First Rite Pack","Iksar Bandit Mask","Master Raska","Iksar bandit","An Iksar master","Tattered Sack from Rinmark","Excavator Claws","Intact Brutling Choppers","Torn Sash","Goblin Sparring Gloves","Full Sack for Master","Iksar Right Hand","The Great Oowomp","A dancing skeleton","Hand With Only a Thumb","Fingered skeleton","Withered 2.5 Inch Finger","Withered 3 Inch Finger","Withered 3.1 Inch Finger","Withered 4 Inch Finger","Iksar Left Hand","A Sarnak courier","Master Niska","Kurn's Tower","Warsliks Wood","Oasis of Marr","Warsliks Woods","Timorous Deep","Talon Southpaw","Klok Poklon","Master Bain","A young ronin","Oasis","A goblin pit fighter","An Outlander's Head","Kwinn the Outlander","Klok Ephmir","Firiona Vie","Tin Box","An Iksar Master","Empty Tin Box (Bronze Shackle)","Pebble Filled Box","Radiant Meteorite","Burning Woods","Gold Nugget","Frontier Mountains","Rile's Sand Coin","Plains Pebble","Petrified Redwood","The Overthere","A Scarlet Stone","A drolvarg scavenger","Jade Magma","A burynai miner","Heart of Ice","Icebone Skeleton","Unholy Coldstone","A goblin priest","Permafrost","Tektite (Item)","Tektite","Carnelian","Tin Merchant IV","Part of a Large Key","Nickel Key","A coerced penkeeper","Copper Key","A goblin interrogator","Droga Jail area","Coppernickel Key","A Bronze Key","A goblin penkeeper","An iksar slave","A crazed iksar slave","Dalnir"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Master Raska","text":"Hmmph!! Expect to be a great master such as I? Maybe. You still appear to be a [whiff]."},{"npc":"Master Raska","text":"A whiff is the sound of a tail striking air. A whiff is you. Inexperienced. I can help you. If you [want to earn the second shackle]."},{"npc":"Master Raska","text":"Then you shall perform the first rite. Take this pack. To the Outlands you will go. You will fill and combine the pack with one of each of the following - Goblin Scout Beads, a Large Scorpion Pincer, a froglok skipper's skipping stone and a Sabertooth Cub Canine. Return the full first rite pack and you shall prove yourself a monk."},{"npc":"Master Raska","text":"You have succeeded, young ______! You have proven yourself a skilled monk. You will now wear the shackle of clay. You will now be required to increase your intensity of training in hopes that you may soon be able to earn your [shackle of stone]."},{"npc":"Master Raska","text":"Interested in the shackle of stone are we? They are made for monks who have earned their first two shackles and are ready to climb up to the next rung. A monk who feels he is ready to wear the shackle of stone must first [perform the task of cleansing]."},{"npc":"Master Raska","text":"Go forth to the outer gates and seek out the Iksar bandits. They have refused to bow to the will of the empire and shall pay dearly for their traitorous ways. They often wear bandit masks. If you return with two bandit masks and the shackles of dust and clay then I shall reward you with the shackle of stone."},{"npc":"Klok Poklon","text":"Greetings, thirsty traveler. Pull up a stool and lay yer copper down. It's time to drink and be merry. Just don't get too merry or I will have to call the troopers."},{"npc":"Master Bain","text":"Seeking Master Rinmark? He has left the Court of Pain. Gone to focus his thoughts on the elements of wind and thunder. I believe he was headed toward the Overthere. That was the last I heard of his trek."},{"npc":"an Iksar master","text":"Disciple Gomoz was once Talon Southpaw's pupil. It is rumored that he has only one hand. Unfortunately, a horde of ogre raiders swiped his bones, along with others, from their place in Kurn's Tower. What those simple oafs plan to do with them is a mystery. Only one who has studied the arcane sciences could use them. They most likely used them as soup bones."},{"npc":"The Great Oowomp","text":"Oh!! You wish to see the great Oowomp perform his magic!! I have studied with the grand mages and wise [McMerin clan] of Norrath, as my speech implies. I can call forth the skeleton with but a twinkling of my power and five of your gold."},{"npc":"a dancing skeleton","text":"A dancing skeleton am I."},{"npc":"a dancing skeleton","text":"Dancing for you and dancing for me."},{"npc":"a dancing skeleton","text":"Gomoz!! Why, that is me! I was heading off to be with the elements when I was captured by this smelly ogre. Actually, he is not as smelly as most."},{"npc":"a dancing skeleton","text":"Dancing for the great Oowomp!! Wheee!!"},{"npc":"a dancing skeleton","text":"Master Talon Southpaw!! He was my master. Dead, he became. Off to the elements. I keep his special hand with me. Perhaps I should have it returned. Maybe I shall find a young adventurer to [return the hand to Cabilis]."},{"npc":"a dancing skeleton","text":"Yes!! Return the hand. Here it is. Missing four it is. Within the tower of past pain and torture is where the four lie. Taken by bones similar to myself."},{"npc":"a dancing skeleton","text":"Dancing and singing is my life!!"},{"npc":"Master Niska","text":"This is not all. Bring me the item this caste seeks and the shackles of stone and rock."},{"npc":"Master Niska","text":"This is not all. Bring me the item this caste seeks and the shackles of stone and rock."},{"npc":"Master Niska","text":"Very good!! Here is your shackle of copper. The emperor shall be pleased that I, Mistress Niska, have slain the outlander. Do you have some time? I need someone to be my [personal courier]? Will you?"},{"npc":"an Iksar master","text":"Alas, there is no time for celebration. I need your help in rescuing a [student] of mine."},{"npc":"an Iksar slave","text":"Then word has gotten to him!! If you be a monk of the third rung I will accept your aid. You must find the [coppernickel key]. It is required to release me from this goblin shackle. I have no reward to offer other than the shackle of steel. Give me both your shackles of the third rung along with the key and I shall reward you the first shackle of the fourth rung."},{"npc":"an Iksar slave","text":"The key is split into three parts. Part one is the base and must be combined with the two remainder pieces. One piece is in here and the other was lost. I overheard the goblins chattering and recognized the goblin phrase, 'lair of flying mouths'!! As for the base, I do not know."},{"npc":"an Iksar slave","text":"I made a pact to reward the shackle of steel to one who could deliver the coppernickel key and the shackles of copper and bronze."},{"npc":"an Iksar slave","text":"I made a pact to reward the shackle of steel to one who could deliver the coppernickel key and the shackles of copper and bronze."},{"npc":"Master Raska","text":"You will get nothing until I hold two bandit masks and the shackles of dust and clay.' Master Raska says, 'You will get nothing until I hold two bandit masks and the shackles of dust and clay.' Master Raska says, 'You will get nothing until I hold two bandit masks and the shackles of dust and clay.' Master Raska says, 'You have done supremely, ______. You have earned your shackle of stone. Mistress Niska will now help you on your way to earning the shackle of rock. May the elements guide you to the next rung."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-07T09:35:36.165Z","outOfEra":true}
